# ── Project docs (kept local, not committed) ──
SYSTEM_DESIGN.md
UI_DESIGN.md

# ── Design prototypes (kept local, not committed) ──
# Throwaway HTML used to compare visual directions before anything is written in
# Swift. Same category as the docs above — UI_DESIGN.md cites these files as the
# reference for settled decisions, and both are local-only, so they stay
# consistent. Ignored as a directory rather than as *.html: narrower, and it
# won't silently swallow a real HTML file later.
Design/

# ── Local-only scratch tooling (realistic sample library + eyeball tests); not shipped ──
SketchListTests/Scratch/

# ── macOS ──
.DS_Store

# ── Xcode: per-user state (breakpoints, window layout, selected scheme, …) ──
# Note: xcshareddata/ (shared schemes) is intentionally NOT ignored.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# ── Xcode: build output ──
build/
DerivedData/

# ── Build artifacts ──
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

# ── Swift Package Manager ──
.build/
.swiftpm/
